WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.530 --> 00:00:02.760
OK, last question today.

00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:06.690
Hey, David, are you worried about violence?

00:00:06.690 --> 00:00:10.050
If Donald Trump loses in November?

00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:16.059
I want to be really careful when talking about
this because I worry that I'm stepping into

00:00:16.059 --> 00:00:27.720
a minefield where I might be giving people
ideas and I really don't want to do that,

00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:29.960
which is why I've sort of resisted talking
about this.

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:32.200
But I think at this point it deserves some
discussion.

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:33.320
OK, let's game it out.

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:34.609
Joe Biden wins by a lot.

00:00:34.609 --> 00:00:36.730
What do Trump ists do?

00:00:36.730 --> 00:00:40.360
Joe Biden wins by a tiny bit.

00:00:40.360 --> 00:00:43.600
What do trumpets do?

00:00:43.600 --> 00:01:03.199
I actually think the more dangerous scenario
is if Biden wins by a little bit, because

00:01:03.199 --> 00:01:17.030
if Biden really just crushes Donald Trump,
my instinct is that you will see Trump ists

00:01:17.030 --> 00:01:29.060
sort of just like pretend nothing ever happened
and say, hey, you know, coronavirus was a

00:01:29.060 --> 00:01:33.469
unique circumstance.

00:01:33.469 --> 00:01:40.659
This isn't really a big loss for Trump.

00:01:40.659 --> 00:01:43.840
This was, you know, people voting because
of a pandemic that affected every country.

00:01:43.840 --> 00:01:45.789
This doesn't say anything about Trump.

00:01:45.789 --> 00:01:46.789
OK.

00:01:46.789 --> 00:01:47.789
Biden's the president.

00:01:47.789 --> 00:01:48.789
Good luck with that, guys.

00:01:48.789 --> 00:01:51.180
And I think you would see Trump has to be
relatively quiet.

00:01:51.180 --> 00:02:00.800
If Biden absolutely blows out Donald Trump
now, more likely is that it's going to be

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:06.320
a maybe a closer election no matter who wins.

00:02:06.320 --> 00:02:14.280
The scenario that scares me is if Biden wins
very narrowly, very, very narrowly.

00:02:14.280 --> 00:02:19.129
And Trump fuels the idea that something unfair
happened.

00:02:19.129 --> 00:02:31.760
That's something that the election cannot
be trusted, that the results have been doctored,

00:02:31.760 --> 00:02:36.190
that it was rigged in some way.

00:02:36.190 --> 00:02:44.769
That's the scenario that really scares me,
particularly in the period between Election

00:02:44.769 --> 00:02:53.379
Day and what would be Joe Biden's inauguration
day.

00:02:53.379 --> 00:03:12.569
That period, in 
my mind, could become one of these where you

00:03:12.569 --> 00:06:02.370
want to stay

00:06:02.370 --> 00:06:04.090
home when the virus is spreading.

00:06:04.090 --> 00:06:08.360
Maybe you would want to stay home during that
as well in certain parts of the country.

00:06:08.360 --> 00:06:13.860
I believe that law enforcement locally, state
federally is more than equipped to handle

00:06:13.860 --> 00:06:14.860
it.

00:06:14.860 --> 00:06:19.290
But that doesn't mean that there could not
be dangers.

00:06:19.290 --> 00:06:24.560
And yes, it is something I'm thinking of and
I am hopeful that it does not go that way.

00:06:24.560 --> 00:06:28.639
If Trump wins, I think it's less likely that
you see that violence.

00:06:28.639 --> 00:06:34.080
I think the scenario most likely to lead to
violence would be a narrow Biden victory,

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:41.259
which Trump cast doubt on the integrity of
the election in a way that really gets his

00:06:41.259 --> 00:06:43.550
base going and going crazy.

00:06:43.550 --> 00:06:45.280
I hope I'm wrong.

00:06:45.280 --> 00:06:48.220
Let me know your thoughts about what you expect,
what you think there.

00:06:48.220 --> 00:06:49.902
We've got a fantastic bonus show for you today.

00:06:49.902 --> 00:06:51.120
It is Friday morning.

00:06:51.120 --> 00:06:54.789
Producer Pat Ford is taking the reins of the
bonus show.

00:06:54.789 --> 00:06:56.030
So that's it for me for the week.

00:06:56.030 --> 00:08:08.300
I will be back with

00:08:08.300 --> 00:08:13.550
you on Monday.

